        "reason": "valid",
        "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqCVHGCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAcEYQAAr5ZMjbxcJkAfunjN7zorm4\npMmLt3gdg/pacA8oo9d/ltflRA0FxjnS1V8PxGPlVe3fzsSr1avbuoJ6fY9mlssl\nO7rgsh4pNEXXOao3p4rQhzStNBOgq6hiAPVdfqb3R+kYzZ0NpY325s+VJOnOvbIF\nR5f++TIf+Bb54UYNVu6HhV0ihqaYghaMeqHIAuO5GJ+/7VL2aBySQQYseXoISVm2\nfPHiRIUE0WHmdb5iRfT64OuLcFrdWdWYq7So7PosJDaiS2VMx+0WHD3WP15KZZnq\n0aCPjV/9rJUBNTaHZ7UXcts/5+jVVD7+F3ppEYgWsStAG+XMOgwZeLo3ogLN1T1f\n24krHQuOl8kO4lK+/sQstPealP1CP6xK6jJiMr8zRJqxQ5BtMhWLpkN9+711/mkJ\nBFH8xfqrdws5pUry3kdUrQh/pOSBBIfAL/ucEegykBs4wpUWMCQinosqqAkWlhUy\nHdVt3TI0FvuCqFObdv6Gux/s0AyX/JVmy7sQpQG41x84Zh9GdqogsaqvoOcqOJkE\n5KeCqvptp+DFdMXPVvm8sY7CS7uoDvglSZudgzChiL6FrS8bZ2QjBTJfvdbkIywW\n0QxcoBPZkvz7cejj8yyE749gCnGqsVZHE+Geoo+XqZ44b9aGQL97OefGu1yByv+O\ndiYsBVDo+XQrMCiIULKh\n=CGPV\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n",
        "payload": "tree bf8b9281e0b6833da99d1ace7dca30ea7b549615\nparent eeb8a3212754544d1b7c51181b81b31dbee23085\nauthor rabble <evan@protest.net> 1778995654 +1200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1778995654 +1200\n\nfix(auth): degrade invalid viewer auth to anonymous (Postel) (#131)\n\nmedia_viewer_context short-circuited to AuthInvalid (401) whenever a\nclient sent an Authorization header that failed to parse, used a bad\nscheme, or failed BUD-01 validation — even when the requested blob was\nPublic. This bricked public-blob playback for any client whose Nostr\nauth header was malformed (e.g. divine-web hitting media.divine.video).\n\nTreat ParseFailed / InvalidScheme / RequestUrlInvalid / ValidationFailed\nas anonymous: log the diagnostic outcome and let BlobMetadata::access_for\nremain the single source of truth on whether auth is required. Public\nblobs now serve; Restricted/AgeRestricted blobs still 401/404 the same\nway they would for a request with no header at all.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>",
